==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|infenitife|t=without end, in perpetuity}}, from {{der|en|LL.|īnfīnītīvus||unlimited, indefinite}}, from {{der|en|la|īnfīnītus||unlimited, infinite}}.<ref>{{R:OED Online|pos=''adj.'' and ''n.''|noformat=1|id=6059610240}}</ref><ref>{{R:Online Etymology Dictionary|pos=n}}</ref> {{surf|en|infinite|-ive}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ɪnˈfɪnɪtɪv/|/ɪnˈfɪnətɪv/}}
